+   *  `"u64"`, `"s8"`, `"s16"`, `"s32"`, `"s64"`, `"f32"`, `"f64"`, `"char"` or
+   *  `"string"`. Part of `witImportCall`'s structured result-type descriptor;
+   *  never evaluated.
+   */
